{"s":108,"name":"Al-Kawthar","meaning":"Abundance","arName":"سُورَةُ الكَوۡثَرِ","type":"Meccan","verses":3,"juz":30,"page":602,"basmala":true,"ayahs":[{"a":1,"ar":"إِنَّآ أَعْطَيْنَٰكَ ٱلْكَوْثَرَ","en":"Indeed, We have granted you, [O Muhammad], al-Kawthar.","juz":30,"page":602},{"a":2,"ar":"فَصَلِّ لِرَبِّكَ وَٱنْحَرْ","en":"So pray to your Lord and sacrifice [to Him alone].","juz":30,"page":602},{"a":3,"ar":"إِنَّ شَانِئَكَ هُوَ ٱلْأَبْتَرُ","en":"Indeed, your enemy is the one cut off.","juz":30,"page":602}]}